OL,3,AHarvey Weinstein sentenced to 15 years
OL,4,Ain prison for sexual assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FDisgraced Hollywood producer Harvey
OL,7,FWeinstein has been sentenced to 15
OL,8,Fyears in prison, after a jury found him
OL,9,Fguilty last year of committing a
OL,10,Fcriminal sexual act against a former
OL,11,Fassistant.
OL,13,FIn a victim impact statement in court,
OL,14,Fhis accuser, Miriam Haley, said the
OL,15,Fassault had a "devastating effect on my
OL,16,Flife and sense of security that may
OL,17,Fnever go away".
OL,19,FAppearing in court in a wheelchair,
OL,20,FWeinstein denied the allegations but
OL,21,Fapologised to "anyone I may have hurt
OL,22,Fby my actions".
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
