OL,3,AHarvey Weinstein sentenced to 15 years
OL,4,Ain prison for sexual assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FWeinstein has already spent six years
OL,7,Fin prison as the cases against him play
OL,8,Fout, and he has a separate conviction
OL,9,Ffor sex crimes in Los Angeles. He has
OL,10,Ffaced three trials in New York over
OL,11,Frape and abuse allegations.
